---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DiscoverShell from "../components/discover/DiscoverShell.astro";
import "../styles/discovery-polish.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面未找到"
  description="这个地址没有对应的页面。返回首页、浏览主题，或搜索你想找的内容。"
  runtime="discover"
  noindex
>
  <DiscoverShell bodyClass="notfound-atlas">
    <section class="notfound-atlas__hero" data-discover-hero aria-labelledby="notfound-atlas-title">
      <div class="notfound-atlas__copy">
        <p class="notfound-atlas__eyebrow">SYSTEM / UNRESOLVED PATH</p>
        <p class="notfound-atlas__code" aria-hidden="true">404<span>_</span></p>
        <h1 id="notfound-atlas-title">页面未找到</h1>
        <p class="notfound-atlas__description">这条线索没有对应的页面。地址可能已改变，也可以从已有的研究目录重新出发。</p>
        <nav class="notfound-atlas__actions" aria-label="返回站点">
          <a href="/">返回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/topics">浏览主题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/archives">文章归档 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="notfound-atlas__figure" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="notfound-atlas__figure-label">FIG. 00 / MISSING CONNECTION</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 370" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path class="notfound-atlas__grid-line" d="M0 74H440M0 148H440M0 222H440M0 296H440M88 0V370M176 0V370M264 0V370M352 0V370"/>
          <circle class="notfound-atlas__target" cx="220" cy="184" r="115"/>
          <circle class="notfound-atlas__target" cx="220" cy="184" r="65"/>
          <circle class="notfound-atlas__target" cx="220" cy="184" r="16"/>
          <path class="notfound-atlas__path" d="M24 296H125L188 226L220 184L252 142L326 74H413"/>
          <path class="notfound-atlas__break" d="M179 244L260 124M179 124L260 244"/>
          <circle class="notfound-atlas__node" cx="24" cy="296" r="7"/>
          <circle class="notfound-atlas__node" cx="413" cy="74" r="7"/>
          <path class="notfound-atlas__axis" d="M220 30V338M60 184H380"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="notfound-atlas__figure-footer">REF: NULL / REQUEST / 404</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="notfound-atlas__footnote">
      <span>INDEX RECOVERY</span>
      <p>站内搜索仍可从顶部导航随时打开；你也可以通过主题、文章归档或研究成果回到内容网络。</p>
    </div>
  </DiscoverShell>
</BaseLayout>
